<p>Conjure a surge of celestial power through your circles. Any foe standing within one of your circles will be slowed by 50% for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 2, 3, 4, 4</acronym> turns and take <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">43, 58, 70, 80, 89</acronym> light and <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">43, 58, 70, 80, 89</acronym> darkness damage.</p><p>Residual power from the surge will emanate from your circles for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 5, 6, 8, 8</acronym> turns; each circle you stand in will increase your celestial resources.</p><p>Shifting Shadows: +1 negative.</p><p>Sanctity: +1 postive.</p><p>Warding: +0.5 postive and negative.</p>